OL,3,APassengers face airport delays as US
OL,4,Aflights resume after nationwide ground
OL,5,Astop
OL,6,
OL,7,FA US nationwide ground stop has been
OL,8,Flifted after an outage halted all
OL,9,Fflights in the country
OL,11,FBut the ripple effects of the
OL,12,Fdisruption are expected to last for
OL,13,Fdays, according to US Transportation
OL,14,FSecretary Sean Duffy
OL,16,FSome flights from the UK to the US have
OL,17,Fbeen delayed or cancelled on Saturday
OL,18,Fmorning, with passengers warned of
OL,19,F"follow-on disruption"
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
