OL,3,APassengers face airport delays as US
OL,4,Aflights resume after nationwide ground
OL,5,Astop
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe grounding began at about 21:00 GMT
OL,8,Fon Friday and lasted about four hours.
OL,9,FIt was the longest in the US since the
OL,10,Fone after the 9/11 attacks in 2001
OL,12,FOfficials say the incident was caused
OL,13,Fby a "telecommunications outage" and
OL,14,Fthat there's "zero evidence" this was a
OL,15,Fcyber-attack
OL,17,FThey have blamed old systems for the
OL,18,Foutage, saying it could happen again
OL,19,Fwithout a "complete overhaul"
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
